      "content": "That makes a lot of sense regarding the Reynolds number and the shift in spectral centroid. Could you elaborate more on the \"vortex cascade\" part? Specifically, I'm looking for a description of how those micro-scale oscillations within the turbulent eddies manifest as audible noise, and if there's a specific way the \"raggedness\" or irregularity of the airflow pattern correlates to the perceived texture of the fricative sound.",
